+#### leiden clustering
+
+To use :func:`ehrapy.tools.leiden`, install the `leiden` extra (which pulls in :mod:`igraph`):
+
+```console
+pip install ehrapy[leiden]
+```
+
 ## From sources
 
 The sources for ehrapy can be downloaded from the [Github repo].
